---
const interests = [
  "Reserving",
  "Ratemaking",
  "Data Science",
  "Problem Solving",
];
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">

    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">
      A little introduction
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-8">
      About Me
    </h2>

    <div class="space-y-5 text-gray-600 leading-8">
      <p>
        Hi! I'm <span class="text-gray-900 font-medium">Your Name</span>,
        a student and aspiring professional passionate about technology,
        software development, and building meaningful things.
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm interested in exploring how technology can solve real-world
        problems. Through academic work and personal projects, I'm
        continuously developing my technical skills and learning new
        technologies.
      </p>

      <p>
        Outside of my studies, I enjoy experimenting with new ideas,
        contributing to projects, and sharing what I learn along the way.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">
        Areas of Interest
      </h3>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {interests.map((interest) => (
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-full border border-gray-200 text-gray-600">
            {interest}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>